    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Team McCullagh are delighted to present Brook Lodge, Lowville, Ahascragh, Ballinasloe, Co. Galway, H53 D560, a spacious five bedroom, four bathroom detached residence extending to approximately 2,190 sq. ft. set on a private and tranquil mature site.\n\nThe property is approached by an impressive long driveway, providing excellent privacy and leading to the residence and its tarmacadam parking area.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a comfortable sitting room with a solid-fuel stove, a spacious kitchen and dining room with patio doors opening onto the rear patio, a utility room, five bedrooms, a main family bathroom and three en-suite bathrooms. The converted upstairs area provides valuable additional space suitable for use as a home office or walk in storage area.\n\nThe residence benefits from a C1 BER and oil-fired central heating, offering comfortable and energy efficient family living.\n\nExternally, Brook Lodge occupies an attractive mature site with a detached garage to the rear, a tarmacadam driveway and a private patio area ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining.\n\nConveniently located approximately ten minutes from Ballinasloe town and just three minutes from Ahascragh village, the property enjoys easy access to shops, pubs, a restaurant and the local distillery. Primary and secondary schools are also available nearby.\n\nThis impressive property offers generous accommodation, privacy and peaceful countryside living within easy reach of essential amenities.\n\nContact estate agent Cathal Meares for further details or to arrange a viewing.\n"
      },
